on exitFrame
  [  0] pushcons 0 .............................. <"gun">
  [  2] pushint8 3 .............................. <3>
  [  5] set 0 ................................... set the keyDownScript to "gun"
  [  7] pushint8 5 .............................. <5>
  [ 10] pusharglist 1 ........................... <5>
  [ 12] extcall 24 .............................. <sprite(5)>
  [ 14] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 15] setobjprop 39 ........................... sprite(5).visible = 0
  [ 18] pushint8 6 .............................. <6>
  [ 21] pusharglist 1 ........................... <6>
  [ 23] extcall 24 .............................. <sprite(6)>
  [ 25] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 26] setobjprop 39 ........................... sprite(6).visible = 0
  [ 29] pushint8 8 .............................. <8>
  [ 32] setlocal 0
  [ 34] getlocal 0
  [ 36] pushint8 30 ............................. <30>
  [ 39] lteq
  [ 40] jmpifz [ 65] ............................ repeat with i = 8 to 30
  [ 43] getlocal 0 .............................. <i>
  [ 45] pusharglist 1 ........................... <i>
  [ 47] extcall 24 .............................. <sprite(i)>
  [ 49] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 52] setobjprop 39 ........................... sprite(i).visible = 1
  [ 55] pushint8 1
  [ 58] getlocal 0
  [ 60] add
  [ 61] setlocal 0
  [ 63] endrepeat [ 34]
  [ 65] pushint8 23 ............................. <23>
  [ 68] setlocal 0
  [ 70] getlocal 0
  [ 72] pushint8 33 ............................. <33>
  [ 75] lteq
  [ 76] jmpifz [ 99] ............................ repeat with i = 23 to 33
  [ 79] getlocal 0 .............................. <i>
  [ 81] pusharglist 1 ........................... <i>
  [ 83] extcall 24 .............................. <sprite(i)>
  [ 85] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 86] setobjprop 39 ........................... sprite(i).visible = 0
  [ 89] pushint8 1
  [ 92] getlocal 0
  [ 94] add
  [ 95] setlocal 0
  [ 97] endrepeat [ 70]
  [ 99] pushint8 40 ............................. <40>
  [102] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [105] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <40, 1>
  [107] extcall 6 ............................... puppetSprite(40, 1)
  [109] ret
end
